Failure is contained; unsafe actions rejected;
recovery reason is logged.
End-to-end Normal and event-driven mission runs Acceptance criteria pass for fixed 
configurations/seeds.
Statistical experiments Repeated scenarios for variant comparisons Metrics are computed from saved traces and
uncertainty is reported.
2. Minimum test scenarios
Scenario Injected condition Expected result
S0: nominal No fault; all routes open All mandatory tasks complete.
S1: heterogeneity Some agents lack required capabilities Only eligible agents receive the tasks.
S2: blocked route Block a key edge before navigation Route recomputed; no blocked edge 
traversed.
S3: agent failure Fail an assigned agent with work remaining Agent excluded; completed tasks preserved; 
pending tasks reconsidered.
S4: malformed LLM output Invalid JSON or absent required field No allocation/execution; bounded retry or 
explicit failure.
S5: invalid plan Unknown zone, capability or cyclic 
dependencies
Plan rejected before dispatch with reason 
code.
S6: low battery Assignment would violate reserve Assignment rejected or charging/replanning 
policy applied.
S7: new task Add task while mission is running Mission/task versions update; allocation is 
recomputed safely.
S8: uncertain task result Agent fails during a task with uncertain 
effect
Task is verified before retry if policy 
requires it.

