Project implementation guide | 22
Module Contract
semantic_validator.py Returns validated plan or a list of stable rejection codes.
optimizer.py Returns assignments and objective/status, or explicit 
infeasibility.
scheduler.py Emits only dependency-ready task dispatch proposals.
safety_monitor.py Approves/rejects each proposed movement/action against 
current state.
simulator.py Applies only approved actions and produces observed 
state/results.
replanner.py Uses events and current state to recompute unfinished work 
while preserving terminal results.
metrics.py Computes aggregates only from saved events/results; does not 
alter simulation state.
