Predictable interface and fail-closed 
behavior
Task allocation Greedy baseline + binary MILP assignment Clear comparison and eligibility constraints
Task sequencing Dependency DAG plus ready-task scheduler Explicit prerequisites; simple debugging
Movement Discrete one-edge-per-tick simulator Makes node and edge-swap collisions 
