Project implementation guide | 25
Final engineering rule: first make the deterministic system correct; then connect generative AI; then measure the 
difference. A plan that is fluent but unvalidated is not executable, an assignment that ignores capability constraints
is not feasible, and a simulation result without reproducible logs is not a defensible experiment.